OL,3,GNEWSADaughter's bed 'propped up on
OL,4,Abooks' says mum amid warning of
OL,5,Adeepening child poverty
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I was sleeping on the sofa, she had a
OL,8,Fbed that was propped up on books. One
OL,9,Fof the legs had fallen off completely."
OL,11,FSarah Ruscoe, a single mum out of work
OL,12,Fbecause of a health condition, said she
OL,13,Fhad worried her daughter's bed would
OL,14,Fcollapse in the night after finding
OL,15,Fherself in a "dire" financial
OL,16,Fsituation.
OL,18,FA food bank user, Ruscoe said "every
OL,19,Fyear seems to be getting worse" as she
OL,20,Fstruggled to make her benefits cover
OL,21,Fessentials.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
